                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-5__item-6">
              <num>30</num>
              <heading>Before subparagraph 8E(1)(d)(iv)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-5__item-6__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-5__item-6__qstr-1__para-iiic">
                  <num>iiic</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a compulsory TSL repayment amount that is notified in the notice of assessment;</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-5__item-7">
              <num>31</num>
              <heading>Before subparagraph 8E(2)(d)(iv)</heading>
